//coping object

1-  spread(...obj) -generally object ko copy karne ka sabse accha way(but not nested(obj ke ander obj) object)



2- object.assign-   object.assign({ price: infinity},obj);     (ye ab jayda use nhi hota h isme jo {}ke ander likha h marji h )





3- deep clone(JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(obj));)- jab nested obj aa jata h to usko copy karne se nested part ka reference milta h na ki real copy milti h 
tp is prob ko solve karne ke liye ham deep clone ka us karte h.

JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(obj)); = iska use karne se stringify se obj string me covert hoga fir waps se obj me covert ho jayega jisse hame real copy milegi.




