////                                           documnets object model(dom)

html me ksis bhi type ka changes dom kehlata h


topic:-
selecting elements:- 
getElementById          :  html me id ke throough element js me  select karna
getElementsByClassName  :  elements ko class deker select karna      (ye bhi same querySelectorAll ki tarha array dega)
querySelector           :  querySelector()             ->iske braces me jo tag apne select karna h wo likhna
querySelectorAll        :  querySelectorAll()          ye bhi same hi h bs ye console me array jaisa STRUCTURE dega 


insbko variable maan lena h 
format :- 
let val  = document.querySelector();
kabhi kabhi console.log karne pe direct tag aajyga to console.dir karna 
note point:- ab ke time pe sabhi companies me ye hi  querySelector  , querySelectorAll us hota h


