// events and eventlistner

select the paragraph like that -> let p = document.querySelector("p);
then realsise karo kya reation dena h paragraph ko like that  p.addEventList("click", function(){
    p.style.color = "green":
});

type of events:-
click
input
change event:- // change event tab chalta h jab aapka koi input select ya textarea me koi change ho jaye
submit
mouseover,mouseout,mousemove
keyup

-> event object:- target, type, prventDefault.
event bubbling:- jispe evebt aayega uspar listner nhi hua to hamara event uske parent par listner dhundhega aur aisa karte karte uper ki taraf move karega 
event capturing :- isko },true);   asie on karte H




NOTE POINT :- jab bhi aap click karte ho y KOI BHI event raise karte ho 
to aapka jo event flow do phases me chalta hai:

phase 1: event top level element se  neeche ki taraf aayega 
phase 2: event raised element se parent ki taraf jaayega 

